	"一次成型，不保存": "One-shot, not saved",
	"一眼看到这一行把流送去了哪": "See at a glance where this row sends traffic",
	"一眼看清现在有没有要处理的事。设备清单在「资产 › 设备」，心跳明细与隧道内遥测在「监控与管理 › 监控」": "See at a glance whether anything needs attention. The device list is under \"Assets › Devices\"; heartbeat details and in-tunnel telemetry under \"Monitoring & management › Monitoring\"",
	"一行 = 一台 DHCP server，绑定客户口自己的地址。可分配池必须落在客户口子网内且不能包含口本身的地址；网关与 DNS 留空 = 用客户口地址（DNS 即本机转发器）。": "One row = one DHCP server, bound to the customer port's own address. The assignable pool must be within the customer port subnet and must not include the port's own address; gateway and DNS empty = use the customer port address (DNS is the local forwarder).",
	"一行 = 一条 NAT 出口：客户口(VPN 内)的流量经出口口出去，源地址翻译成地址池里的地址。池是显式配置的——要用出口口自己的地址就把那个地址写进池里；池里的地址必须能收到回程流量，否则翻译出去就回不来。": "One row = one NAT egress: traffic from customer ports (inside the VPN) goes out through the egress port, with the source address translated to an address from the pool. The pool is explicit — to use the egress port's own address, write that address into the pool; addresses in the pool must be able to receive return traffic, otherwise translated traffic never comes back.",
	"一行 = 一条 NAT 出口：客户口（VPN 内）的流量经出口口出去，源地址翻译成地址池里的地址。池是显式配置的，地址要能收到回程流量；出口口自己的地址不能进池（管理面会失联）。行挂在基础配置的客户口上": "One row = one NAT egress: traffic from customer ports (inside the VPN) goes out through the egress port, with the source address translated to an address from the pool. The pool is explicit, and addresses must be able to receive return traffic; the egress port's own address must not be in the pool (the management plane would go offline). Rows attach to customer ports in the base config",
	"一行 = 一类流走哪个颜色。空着的字段表示任意；行号就是匹配顺序，前面的行先命中，所以更宽的行要放在上面。 入口口不用选：一行策略挂到它所属 VPN 的**全部**客户口上。这个 VPN 一个客户口都没有时，这一行会被拒。 动态行不钉颜色：盒子盯着到指定对端的每条颜色隧道的探针指标（延迟/抖动/丢包），满足门槛的里面挑延迟最低的一条。全部不达标时走最接近的一条，不会因为一时抖动断流。默认粘住：当前隧道还达标就一直用，更优的不抢；勾上\"抢占\"才永远追最优。\"当前颜色\"是盒子上报的实时选择。": "One row = which color a class of traffic takes. Empty fields mean any; row number is match order, earlier rows match first, so broader rows go on top. No ingress port to choose: a policy row attaches to **all** customer ports of its VPN. If this VPN has no customer ports at all, the row is rejected. Dynamic rows do not pin a color: the box watches the probe metrics (latency/jitter/loss) of every color tunnel to the specified peer and picks the one with the lowest latency among those meeting the threshold. When none qualifies, it takes the closest one, so traffic never drops from a moment of jitter. Sticky by default: the current tunnel stays in use while it still qualifies, and better ones do not steal it; check \"preempt\" to always chase the best. \"Current color\" is the real-time choice reported by the box.",
