	"先把名称、序列号和站点登记进控制器，配置就能在盒子到货之前做完。现场入网时多带一个参数——这个参数就是下面这个索引（一般是设备名称）：": "Register the name, serial, and site in the controller first, and the config can be finished before the box arrives. On-site enrollment carries one extra parameter — that parameter is the index below (usually the device name):",
