	"入口按内层 DSCP 打 3bit 类别，类别随 SR 头 action 端到端传递；出方向物理口按最外层 DSCP 进 4 队列（LLQ+DRR+令牌桶+尾丢）。速率是外层字节口径（含加密与 SR 头开销，约为内层 1.06 倍）。仅对已升级 sr_wg 插件 ≥ 1.1.0 的盒子生效。": "Ingress marks a 3-bit class by inner DSCP, and the class travels end to end in the SR header action; egress on the physical port goes into 4 queues by outer DSCP (LLQ+DRR+token bucket+tail drop). The rate is measured in outer bytes (including encryption and SR header overhead, about 1.06× the inner payload). Applies only to boxes upgraded to the sr_wg plugin ≥ 1.1.0.",
