	"删除一个策略只是把这个策略的 RT 从成员表上摘下来：已经在那条路由上跑着的流量会等设备下一次装配置才收敛。RT 不会被回收给下一个策略。这一页的保存同样要等一次「基础配置」发布才到设备。": "Deleting a policy only removes that policy's RT from the member table: traffic already running on that route waits for the device's next config install to converge. The RT is not recycled to the next policy. Saving on this page likewise needs one \"Base config\" publish to reach the device.",
