	"反射器（RR）": "Route reflector (RR)",
	"反射器（RR）清单与逃生开关：RR 归本租户所有、在这里增删改；某台设备到底连哪两台，在「导通策略配置」的设备表里选（RR 1 / RR 2 两列），没选的设备不建 RR 邻居。这一页保存的是下一次发布的输入，改完要在「基础配置」发布，设备才会拿到": "Reflector (RR) list and escape switch: RRs belong to this tenant and are added, removed and edited here; which two a given device actually connects to is selected in the device table under \"Steering policy config\" (the RR 1 / RR 2 columns); devices with none selected build no RR neighbors. This page saves the input for the next publish; after editing you must publish in \"Base config\" for devices to get it",
	"发布": "Publish",
