	"台账保留": "Ledger retention",
	"台账按天存一个文件，超过保留天数的文件由控制器清掉；改成更短的天数立刻生效，": "The ledger stores one file per day; files older than the retention days are cleaned up by the controller; shortening the retention takes effect immediately,",
	"台账按天存一个文件，超过保留天数的文件由控制器清掉；改成更短的天数立刻生效，删掉的历史找不回来。这个保留期是整台控制器共用的——台账目录所有租户一份，改了对所有人都生效。": "The ledger stores one file per day; the controller removes files beyond the retention days. Shortening the retention takes effect immediately, and deleted history cannot be recovered. This retention period is shared by the whole controller — the ledger directory is one copy for all tenants, so a change affects everyone.",
	"台账离线：": "Ledger offline:",
	"号（rr1、rr2…）删了不回收，所以下一次添加的一定是个新号，": "numbers (rr1, rr2…) are not reused after deletion, so the next one added is always a new number,",
