	"告警升起 / 恢复时向 webhook 发一条 JSON POST（5 秒超时，失败只记日志不重试）。": "When an alert is raised / cleared, a JSON POST is sent to the webhook (5-second timeout; on failure only logged, no retry).",
	"告警恢复": "Alert recovered",
	"告警由控制器按规则自动升起与恢复：设备失联、隧道丢包连续超标、BFD down、": "Alerts are raised and cleared automatically by the controller according to rules: device offline, tunnel packet loss over the threshold for consecutive periods, BFD down,",
	"告警由控制器按规则自动升起与恢复：设备失联、隧道丢包连续超标、BFD down、动态策略行没有候选隧道满足 SLA、设备在线但遥测中断。升起与恢复都会写进下面的台账并推送到 webhook。": "Alerts are raised and recovered automatically by the controller per rules: device offline, tunnel loss over threshold repeatedly, BFD down, dynamic policy row with no candidate tunnel meeting the SLA, device online but telemetry interrupted. Both raises and recoveries are written to the ledger below and pushed to the webhook.",
	"告警设置已保存": "Alert settings saved",
	"告警通知": "Alert notifications",
