	"命令已复制": "Command copied",
	"命令已进入队列，等设备下一次心跳拉取": "Command queued, waiting for the device's next heartbeat",
	"命令随设备下一次心跳下发（默认 5 秒一颗），设备执行后结果自动回到下面。": "The command is delivered on the device's next heartbeat (default one every 5 seconds); after the device runs it the result comes back below automatically.",
	"和客户侧谁建会话：BGP（eBGP 必须直连，iBGP 要能递归到邻居）与 OSPF（每个 VPN 一个实例）。": "who sessions are built with on the customer side: BGP (eBGP must be directly connected; iBGP must be able to recurse to the neighbor) and OSPF (one instance per VPN).",
	"和客户侧谁建会话：BGP（eBGP 必须直连，iBGP 要能递归到邻居）与 OSPF（每个 VPN 一个实例）。学到的前缀进不进 overlay、怎么打 tag，是「Overlay 配置」那组的事，不在这里": "Who builds the session with the customer side: BGP (eBGP must be directly connected, iBGP must be able to recurse to the neighbor) and OSPF (one instance per VPN). Whether learned prefixes go into the overlay and how they are tagged is the business of the \"Overlay config\" group, not here",
