	"在「Underlay 配置 › 全局配置」里改，这一页不复制它的值——两处显示同一个数就会有两处可能说错。": "Change it in \"Underlay config › Global config\"; this page does not copy its value — showing the same number in two places means two places that can be wrong.",
	"在「操作」列写「删除」（或把整行删掉并勾上「以文件为准」）。": "Write \"delete\" in the \"Action\" column (or delete the whole row and check \"Use file as source\").",
