	"在加载好之前先画逻辑视图。": "Draws the logical view before loading finishes.",
	"在另一台机器上跑一条命令，它自己会把这个集群的状态拉过去，然后作为 learner 追上日志。": "Run one command on another machine; it pulls this cluster's state itself and then catches up on the log as a learner.",
