	"地址": "Address",
	"地址不合法": "Invalid address",
	"地址必填，而且要带端口（ip:port 或 域名:port）": "Address is required and must include a port (ip:port or domain:port)",
	"地址必须带端口：设备上的路由进程要从 host:port 里拆出 TLS 服务名，": "The address must include a port: the routing process on the device extracts the TLS server name from host:port,",
	"地址必须带端口：设备上的路由进程要从 host:port 里拆出 TLS 服务名，少了端口只能到设备上过一遍才知道写错了。同一条地址不能加两次——一台盒子两个身份会把同一份路由反射两遍。": "The address must include a port: the routing process on the device has to extract the TLS service name from host:port; without a port, a mistake only surfaces after a round trip on the device. The same address cannot be added twice — two identities on one box would reflect the same routes twice.",
	"地址或归属改了会标「需重签」，不会自动签发。": "Changing the address or ownership marks it \"Re-sign required\"; nothing is signed automatically.",
	"地址池": "Address pool",
	"地址用观测到的外层地址、端口自动分配。": "The address uses the observed outer address; the port is assigned automatically.",
	"地址留空就用反射器最近一次观测到的外层地址；观测过期时创建会被拒绝，需要手填地址或等设备重新上报。": "If the address is empty, the outer address most recently observed by the reflector is used; if the observation has expired, creation is rejected — enter the address by hand or wait for the device to report again.",
	"地址的主机部分写进 SAN（端口不进证书）。私钥随响应返回一次，控制器不保存、日志里也没有。": "The host part of the address goes into the SAN (the port does not enter the certificate). The private key is returned once with the response; the controller does not store it and it is not in the logs.",
