	"学到的前缀进不进 overlay、怎么打 tag，是「Overlay 配置」那组的事，不在这里": "Whether learned prefixes enter the overlay and how they are tagged is the job of the \"Overlay config\" group, not this page",
	"它也不再参与多数派。剩下的成员必须仍然占多数，否则写会停。": "It also stops taking part in the majority. The remaining members must still hold a majority, or writes stop.",
	"它已经在网格里的话，本租户其它 RR 下一次拉取（≤30s）就会把这个邻居去掉；这条 RR 自己再来拉会拿到 404，sr-rr 会据此停服退出。": "If it is already in the mesh, the tenant's other RRs drop this neighbor on their next poll (≤30s); when this RR polls again it gets a 404, and sr-rr stops and exits on that basis.",
	"它拿这张证书来拉本租户的邻居清单，本租户的 RR 自动组成网格。新增一条只让新 RR 去拨已有的，已有 RR 的会话不重建；": "It uses this certificate to pull this tenant's neighbor list; the tenant's RRs automatically form a mesh. Adding one only makes the new RR dial the existing ones; established RR sessions are not rebuilt;",
	"它的控制台 host:port": "Its console host:port",
