	"实时": "Real-time",
	"实时连接重连中": "Reconnecting live connection",
	"客户": "Customer",
	"客户 loopback": "customer loopback",
	"客户侧前缀上报进 SD-WAN：按（设备, VPN）选来源、挂 prefix-list 白名单，命中白名单的前缀才进 overlay。prefix-list 库两个方向共用；保存只写草稿，发布走和「基础配置」同一条路径（设备下一次心跳拉取）": "Customer-side prefixes reported into the SD-WAN: choose the source by (device, VPN) and attach a prefix-list allowlist; only prefixes that match the allowlist enter the overlay. The prefix-list library is shared by both directions; saving writes only the draft, and publishing takes the same path as \"Base config\" (the device pulls on its next heartbeat)",
	"客户口": "Customer port",
	"客户口是客户流量的入口：地址按所属 VPN 配置，MTU 与管理状态也按口设置。": "The customer port is the entry point for customer traffic: the address is configured per its VPN, and MTU and admin state are set per port.",
	"客户口（inside）": "Customer port (inside)",
	"客户口（监听它的地址 :53）": "Customer port (listens on its address :53)",
	"客户和运营方用同一个入口登录；能看到什么、能改什么由账号角色决定。": "Customers and operators sign in through the same entry point; what an account can see and change is decided by its role.",
	"客户在真正激活设备时自己生成一次性入网码；运营方看不到码的明文": "The customer generates a one-time claim code when actually activating a device; operators never see the plaintext",
	"客户在真正激活设备时自己生成一次性码（默认 5 分钟有效）；运营方看不到码的明文，控制器只保存哈希。": "The customer generates a one-time code when actually activating a device (valid for 5 minutes by default); the operator never sees the plaintext, and the controller stores only a hash.",
	"客户已经在用的端口段；必须落在 VPN 端口池内，不能与中转端口池重叠。": "A port range the customer already uses; it must fall inside the VPN port pool and must not overlap the relay port pool.",
	"客户登录名（可选）": "Customer login name (optional)",
	"客户登录后，在「入网授权」页点「生成」，选有效期（默认 5 分钟）": "After signing in, the customer clicks \"Generate\" on the \"Claim grants\" page and picks a validity period (default 5 minutes)",
	"客户账号绑定一个租户，只能看到自己租户的内容；运营账号不绑定租户，也看不到任何设备配置。": "A customer account is bound to one tenant and can see only its own tenant's content; an operator account is not bound to a tenant and cannot see any device configuration either.",
	"客户（租户）": "Customer (tenant)",
