	"成员的加入/移除是共识写：多数派落盘之后才生效。": "Adding or removing a member is a consensus write: it takes effect once the majority has persisted it.",
	"成员的加入/移除是共识写：多数派落盘之后才生效。新成员先当 learner（不参与多数派）把日志追平，再提升为 voter —— 这样\"加一台\"不会让集群短暂失去多数派。": "Adding or removing a member is a consensus write: it takes effect only after a majority has persisted it. A new member first joins as a learner (outside the majority) to catch up the log, then is promoted to voter — so \"adding one node\" does not briefly cost the cluster its majority.",
