	"才把当前这一版发给设备——发布之后设备也要等下一次心跳才拉下来，所以「保存了但没发布」和「发布了但设备还没拉」都不是故障。": "only then is the current version sent to the device — and after publishing, the device still pulls it at its next heartbeat, so \"saved but not published\" and \"published but not yet pulled\" are both normal, not faults.",
