	"控制器集群": "Controller cluster",
	"控制面自己跑在几台机器上：只有 leader 接受写，其余节点只读并把设备的心跳接住。": "The control plane itself runs on several machines: only the leader accepts writes; the rest are read-only and take in device heartbeats.",
	"控制面自己跑在几台机器上：只有 leader 接受写，其余节点只读并把设备的心跳接住。新增 / 替换 / 下线都在这一页完成 —— 新机器只要跑一条带加入码的命令，不需要后台部署。设备不需要 VIP：心跳应答里带着完整地址表，agent 自己轮换": "How many machines the control plane itself runs on: only the leader accepts writes; the other nodes are read-only and take the device heartbeats. Adding, replacing and retiring nodes all happen on this page — a new machine just runs one command with a join code, with no backend deployment. Devices need no VIP: the heartbeat reply carries the full address table, and the agent rotates on its own",
