	"撤销「": "Revoke \"",
	"撤销一条已认领的只删登记，设备与配置不动。配置页的设备列表里，这些预授权和真设备混在一起按条件过滤。": "Revoking a claimed one deletes only the registration; the device and configuration stay. In the device list on the config page, these pre-authorizations are mixed with real devices and filtered by the same conditions.",
	"撤销一条没认领的登记会连带删掉它的草稿并释放名额；": "Revoking an unclaimed registration also deletes its draft and frees the seat;",
	"撤销一条没认领的登记会连带删掉它的草稿并释放名额；撤销一条已认领的只删登记，设备与配置不动。配置页的设备列表里，这些预授权和真设备混在一起按条件过滤。": "Revoking an unclaimed registration also deletes its draft and frees the seat; revoking a claimed one deletes only the registration, leaving the device and its config untouched. In the device list on the config page, these pre-authorizations and real devices are mixed together and filtered by condition.",
	"撤销登记": "Revoke registration",
