	"收起": "Collapse",
	"改了但还没发布": "Changed but not published",
	"改了立刻存进控制器，但同样要等「基础配置」发布、设备来拉才换——所以改完先别急着看设备那边变。": "Changes are stored in the controller immediately, but as always they take effect only after \"Base config\" is published and the device pulls — so do not rush to look for the change on the device.",
	"改优先级或间隔会让两台盒子重新选主备，客户侧网关会短暂切换到另一台（约 3 倍通告间隔）。": "Changing the priority or interval makes the two boxes re-elect primary and backup, and the customer-side gateway briefly switches to the other one (about 3× the advertisement interval).",
	"改前缀列表内容本身不会推到设备，编辑完要回到引用它的设备上再发布一次。": "Editing the prefix-list contents itself is not pushed to devices; after editing, go back to the devices that reference it and publish again.",
	"改动同时决定两端：对端走的顺序自动是这条链的反向。": "A change decides both ends: the peer's order is automatically the reverse of this chain.",
	"改名称/站点": "Change name/site",
	"改名称等于换索引：现场要用新名字认领。": "Renaming changes the index: the new name must be used to claim in the field.",
	"改名额": "Change seats",
