	"改成「直连」会丢掉中转；地址留空表示改回使用观测地址。": "Switching to \"Direct\" drops the relay; leaving the address empty means going back to the observed address.",
	"改成另一条链是整条替换：新的顺序会一起下发，旧链不会留下一跳。": "Switching to another chain replaces the whole thing: the new order is delivered together, and no hop of the old chain remains.",
	"改经纬度只影响地图上的位置，不动设备本身；": "Changing longitude and latitude only affects the map position, not the device itself;",
	"改颜色或权重会让路由重建，正在走的流量有短暂收敛中断。": "Changing the color or weight rebuilds routes; in-flight traffic has a brief convergence interruption.",
