	"来源未知": "Unknown source",
	"来自控制器的台账采样，一条线 = 到一个对端的隧道（图例带颜色号）。单台设备的隧道可能有上千条，先用右边的选择器挑一条单独看；设备失联的时间段自然是空的——空档本身就是发生过事情的证据。": "Ledger samples from the controller; one line = a tunnel to one peer (the legend carries the color number). A single device may have thousands of tunnels, so use the selector on the right to pick one and view it alone; the period when a device was offline is naturally blank — the gap itself is evidence that something happened.",
