	"模板是共享的中转链：编辑模板会同时移动所有引用它的隧道，删除前必须先解除引用。链的顺序就是包被弹的顺序。": "A template is a shared relay chain: editing it moves every tunnel that references it, and references must be removed before deleting it. The chain order is the order packets are bounced.",
