	"正式上线后运营方用账号 + MFA 登录，令牌只留作救急": "In production, operators sign in with an account + MFA; the token is kept only for emergencies",
	"每个 VPN 自己那张表": "Each VPN has its own table",
	"每台新设备占一个名额，重复入网同一台设备不再占名额": "Each new device uses one seat; re-enrolling the same device does not use another",
	"每台设备的每张 VPN 各自展开：这台设备没有的 VPN、": "Each VPN on each device is expanded separately: VPNs this device does not have,",
	"每台设备的每张 VPN 各自展开：这台设备没有的 VPN、没有对应实例的来源都会被去掉并写清原因；一行都不剩的（设备, VPN）整行丢弃。整批要么全写、要么一行不写；写完后每台受影响的设备各发布一次。": "Each VPN of each device is expanded separately: VPNs the device does not have, and sources with no matching instance, are removed with the reason stated; any (device, VPN) left with no rows is discarded entirely. The batch is all or nothing — either every row is written or none is; afterwards each affected device is published once.",
	"每增加一个 VPN，就多一套独立的转发表和 BGP/OSPF；客户口与静态路由按 VPN 归属。": "Each additional VPN adds a separate forwarding table and BGP/OSPF instance; customer ports and static routes belong to a VPN.",
	"每条诊断（发起与结果）都写进「台账与告警」的事件流水；结果输出在台账里保留前 4KB。": "Every diagnostic (initiation and result) is written to the event stream in \"Ledger and alerts\"; the first 4KB of the output is kept in the ledger.",
	"每条隧道的运行状态仍是「未知」：设备会回报它自己建了几条隧道（见设备表的「隧道下发」列），但遥测行按数据面接口索引记账，控制器还没把每一行对到某条隧道上。": "Every tunnel's operational state is still \"unknown\": a device does report how many tunnels it built (see the \"Tunnels pushed\" column in the device table), but telemetry rows are accounted by data-plane interface index, and the controller does not yet map each row to a specific tunnel.",
	"每次「发布到设备」都会在这里留一份快照（最多 20 份）。回滚会把那个版本的草稿内容恢复回来、": "Every \"Publish to device\" leaves a snapshot here (at most 20). Rolling back restores that version's draft content,",
	"每组连线是一个设备对：同一设备对之间只能有一条隧道": "Each group of links is one device pair: only one tunnel is allowed between a given pair",
	"池是显式配置的，地址要能收到回程流量；出口口自己的地址不能进池（管理面会失联）。": "The pool is configured explicitly, and addresses must be able to receive return traffic; the egress port's own address cannot go into the pool (the management plane would go offline).",
