	"租户级的隧道参数：VPN 端口池、中转端口池、overlay 地址池与探测间隔。保存只写草稿，发布后才成为设备的目标配置，并给每台已入网设备分配唯一的中转端口；发布以后才入网的设备在入网时自动补分配": "Tenant-level tunnel parameters: VPN port pool, relay port pool, overlay address pool and probe interval. Saving writes only the draft; after publishing they become the devices' target configuration and each enrolled device is assigned a unique relay port; devices that enroll after publishing are allocated automatically at enrollment",
