	"站点里两台盒子的网关冗余：两台各配一条 vr_id 与虚拟地址相同的记录，优先级高的当主。记录挂在基础配置的客户口上": "Gateway redundancy for the two boxes at a site: configure one record on each box with the same vr_id and virtual address; the higher priority becomes primary. The record hangs on the customer port in the base config",
