	"草稿可以随时改；「保存并发布」把当前草稿发布给设备。已分配的端口和 overlay /32 不会因为重发而被移动：池子收窄到装不下它们的发布会直接被拒绝。": "The draft can be changed at any time; \"Save and publish\" publishes the current draft to devices. Allocated ports and overlay /32s are not moved by republishing: a publish that narrows the pool until it cannot hold them is rejected outright.",
