	"要激活设备时点「生成」并选有效期；码只显示这一次，重新生成或过期后旧码立即失效。名额按设备计：每激活一台新设备占一个名额，同一台设备重复入网不再占名额；在「设备」页预授权一台还没到货的盒子，从创建那一刻就占名额（撤销登记会放回来）。": "To activate a device, click \"Generate\" and pick a validity period; the code is shown only this once, and the old code stops working immediately when you regenerate or it expires. Seats are counted per device: each new device activated takes one seat, and the same device enrolling again takes no further seat; pre-authorizing a box that has not arrived yet on the \"Devices\" page takes a seat from the moment it is created (revoking the registration releases it).",
